## Test Data Builders

**File**: [Builders/TradeBuilder.cs](Builders/TradeBuilder.cs)

Fluent builder pattern for creating test data:

```csharp
var trade = TradeBuilder.Default()
    .WithTradeReference("TRD-001")
    .WithInstrument("AAPL")
    .WithQuantity(100)
    .WithPrice(150.50m)
    .WithState(TcrState.Received)
    .Build();
```

The builder provides:
- Sensible defaults for all fields
- Fluent API for customization
- Helper methods like `WithInvalidFields()`
- Immutable pattern (each method returns a new builder)

